OL,3,GNEWSABiker, 19, who fell into sea after
OL,4,Acliffside crash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have renewed an appeal for
OL,7,Finformation about the death of a
OL,8,F19-year-old motorcyclist who fell into
OL,9,Fthe sea following a crash.
OL,11,FOfficers from North Wales Police were
OL,12,Fcalled to reports of a crash involving
OL,13,Fa motorcycle on Marine Drive on the
OL,14,FGreat Orme in Llandudno, Conwy county,
OL,15,Fat 22:30 GMT on October 29. The RNLI
OL,16,Fand HM Coastguard were also in
OL,17,Fattendance.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
