OL,3,GNEWSABiker, 19, who fell into sea after
OL,4,Acliffside crash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man, who has been named locally as
OL,7,FFilip Szwarnog-Stepien, was recovered
OL,8,Ffrom the water and airlifted to Ysbyty
OL,9,FGwynedd in Bangor, where he was
OL,10,Fpronounced dead.
OL,12,FThree males, aged between 17 and 18,
OL,13,Fwere arrested and interviewed in
OL,14,Fconnection with the incident, and have
OL,15,Fsince been released while enquiries
OL,16,Fcontinue.
